      }
    },
    "Checks a Tesla vehicle's current battery percentage, estimated driving range in miles, charge limit, and active charging status. Omit the vehicle parameter to inspect the user's selected car.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "배터리 퍼센트, 예상 주행 거리, 충전 한도, 충전 상태를 확인합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checks a Tesla vehicle's tire pressure monitoring system (TPMS) readings in PSI for front-left, front-right, rear-left, and rear-right tires. Omit the vehicle parameter to inspect the user's selected car.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "네 타이어의 공기압(PSI)을 확인합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checks whether the car's Tesla firmware has a software update (read-only): the installed version, any newer version, and whether it's downloading (with progress), ready to install, scheduled, or installing, plus how long the install takes. To hear what's new, use the Read Tesla Release Notes tool. To install, use the Install Tesla Software Update tool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "설치된 버전과 새 버전, 다운로드·설치 가능·예약·설치 중 여부와 예상 시간을 확인합니다. 새 내용은 릴리즈 노트, 설치는 소프트웨어 업데이트 설치를 사용합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose open to open and unlock the charge port, or close to close the motorized charge port door.": {
      "localizations": {
