            "value": "사용자가 말한 조건만 채우세요. “공항에 마지막으로 간 때”는 도착지 Airport, 결과 1개입니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the settings the user asked for; leave the others empty so they stay as they are. For example, \"warm it to 72 and heat my seat\" is 22 °C with driver seat heat 3.": {
